    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24470" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter-spersus</span></b> , a, um
		spargo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>strewn</i>, <i>sprinkled upon</i> or
