				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">interspersus rara canitie,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 5, p. 165, 36</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sunt multa naturae munere interspersa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Mag. p. 299, 30</span></i>
			.</div>
